<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1200 675' width='1200' height='675' font-family='Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='1200' height='675' fill='#fbfaf8'/><defs><marker id='a' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='8' refY='5' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='6' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#ff4a1c'/></marker></defs><text x='60' y='80' font-size='34' font-weight='800' fill='#121212'>View Transition API</text><rect x='60' y='200' width='300' height='180' rx='16' fill='#fff' stroke='#e5e5e5' stroke-width='2'/><text x='210.0' y='280.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='23' font-weight='700' fill='#121212'>Old view</text><text x='210.0' y='312.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#666'>snapshot captured</text><line x1='365' y1='290' x2='435' y2='290' stroke='#ff4a1c' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#a)'/><rect x='440' y='200' width='320' height='180' rx='16' fill='#fff6f2' stroke='#ff4a1c' stroke-width='2'/><text x='600.0' y='280.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='23' font-weight='700' fill='#121212'>Update DOM</text><text x='600.0' y='312.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#666'>in startViewTransition()</text><line x1='765' y1='290' x2='835' y2='290' stroke='#ff4a1c' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#a)'/><rect x='840' y='200' width='300' height='180' rx='16' fill='#fff' stroke='#e5e5e5' stroke-width='2'/><text x='990.0' y='280.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='23' font-weight='700' fill='#121212'>New view</text><text x='990.0' y='312.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='17' fill='#666'>animated with CSS</text><text x='60' y='450' font-size='21' fill='#121212'>Same-document (SPAs) and cross-document (multi-page) transitions; style with ::view-transition-*.</text><text x='60' y='640' font-size='20' fill='#666'>Progressive enhancement: without support, the update simply happens instantly.</text></svg>